  "description": "Independent Python data engineering and natural language processing case study of approximately 2.2 million New York Times article-metadata records. Includes data-quality auditing, TF-IDF, VADER lexical sentiment, sampled spaCy NER, and Matplotlib charts. The source CSV is not distributed and the optional RAG prototype has incomplete setup.",
